              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बिसरना (bisarnā) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi bisarnā, \"to forget\", under Sanskrit vismarati, \"forgets\" (CDIAL 12021). It belongs to songs and older speech; the thing forgotten is the subject."
